---
import '../styles/pages/about.scss'

import {Image} from 'astro:assets';

import Hero from '../../public/images/Jesse-HeroBG.png'

import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Jesse Hodgson / About">

	<Header/>

	<section class="bio">

		<Image
				width="400"
				height="665"
				alt="Jesse Hodgson"
				src={Hero}
				class="hero"
				loading="eager"
		/>

		<h2><span class="special-text"> Jesse "SpaceGameDev" Hodgson </span></h2>

		<h3> AvGeek, Photographer, and Software Developer</h3>

	</section>

	<section class="long-bio">

		<p style="text-align: left;">
			I was born in Charlotte, North Carolina, and have lived here all my life.
			My nickname, "SpaceGameDev", is derived from my love of everything related to Spaceflight, and my passion
			for Software Development and Video Games.

			<br/><br/>

			Starting my professional journey with Software Development and IT in 2021, I created my first mod for
			Satisfactory, called "Factory Props".
			Since then I have significantly increased my expertise through both first-hand experience and online
			resources.
			In Fall 2023, I obtained my IT Support Certificate from Google.
			Since then, I've been learning as much as I can, and helping friends and family with tech issues.

			<br/><br/>

			I've taken up photography more recently, and since I already love to go planespotting at my local airport, I
			take lots of plane photos there.


		</p>

	</section>

	<Footer/>

</Layout>